<title>ITALY: Italy February wholesale prices rose 0.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Italy February wholesale prices rose 0.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>National statistics office ISTAT gave the following Italian wholesale price data for February.</p>
<p> WHOLESALE PRICES	 Feb 97	 Jan 97     Feb 96</p>
<p> Year/Year change	 +0.5 pct     +1.0 pct    +8.2 pct</p>
<p> Month/Month change     -0.1 pct     +0.3 pct    +0.3 pct</p>
<p> Index (base 1990 =100) 134.6	  134.8	 133.9</p>
</text>
